# API module structure

When creating or editing files under `apps/api/src`, follow `.cursor/skills/api-module-structure/SKILL.md`.

- Module-owned types and interfaces live in `type/` (shapes only — no helpers).
- Request DTOs live in `dto/`, one file per DTO (no monolithic `dto.ts`).
- Constants and static datasets live in `const/` or `*.data.ts`.
- Each file has one job: controller = HTTP, service = orchestration, mapper / factory / mutate = that concern only.
- Shared contracts use `@rad/types` or `common/`; do not re-declare them inside a feature.
- When touching a module, migrate its types/DTOs into this layout in the same change when practical.
